    {
      "number": 4386,
      "text": "And he [i.e., Jesus] will be a sign of the Hour; so do not have doubt about it and follow me[25]. This is a straight path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 494,
      "ruku": 429,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4387,
      "text": "Do not let Satan turn you away [from the straight path], for he is your sworn enemy.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 494,
      "ruku": 429,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4388,
      "text": "When Jesus came with clear signs, he said, “I have come to you with wisdom, and to clarify to you some of that concerning which you differ; so fear Allah and obey me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 63,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 494,
      "ruku": 429,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4389,
      "text": "Indeed, Allah is my Lord and your Lord; so worship Him. This is a straight path.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 64,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 494,
      "ruku": 429,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4390,
      "text": "But the factions differed among themselves [about Jesus]; so woe to the wrongdoers from the punishment of a painful Day!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 494,
      "ruku": 429,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4391,
      "text": "Are they waiting except for the Hour to come upon them by surprise when they least expect it?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 494,
      "ruku": 429,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4392,
      "text": "On that Day, close friends will become enemies to one another, except the righteous,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 494,
      "ruku": 429,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4393,
      "text": "[It will be said to them], “O My slaves, there is no fear for you Today, nor will you grieve,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 494,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4394,
      "text": "[those] who believed in Our verses and submitted [to Us as Muslims].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
